			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Indici boves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 21, 30, § 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animal,</span>”
